## Grafana and Prometheus

Start the local monitoring stack with Docker Compose:

```sh
docker compose up -d
```

- Grafana: http://localhost:3000 (default login: `admin` / `admin`; change the password on first login)
- Prometheus: http://localhost:9090

Grafana is provisioned with Prometheus as its default data source. Prometheus
scrapes its own metrics every 15 seconds. To monitor another service, add its
scrape configuration to `prometheus/prometheus.yml` and restart Prometheus:

```sh
docker compose restart prometheus
```

Stop the services with `docker compose down`. Data is retained in named Docker
volumes; use `docker compose down -v` to remove it.
